BRAWL MODE ONLINE CONTEST HAS STARTED!
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/36660602/1715525accec61df35ddeef29bc6886520dad2ac.png September 2nd - 9th {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/36660602/1715525accec61df35ddeef29bc6886520dad2ac.png

RULES

Win the most matches in the Brawl online multiplayer mode while the contests lasts—from September 2nd to 9th. Brawl is accessible from the main menu. Note: beating the first four levels of the singleplayer mode is required to unlock Brawl;
The total of 6 (six) winners will be determined. 3 players who either have the most victories or have reached the limit of 30 victories first will get their well-deserved rewards. We will also reward 3 random contest participants, so even if you don't get a lot of wins—SHARE YOUR RESULT, you will still have a chance to win;
Oh, the reward! Well, the reward is an amazing exclusive "Brawl Winner" t-shirt. The winners will be able to choose their sizes before shipping:
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/36660602/5da890165236e8d842ac5bf49c724e70ff009b9b.png

Share screenshots of your Brawl results either in the comments of this announcement post (via Steam screenshot functionality or uploaded to Imgur) or on our official Discord server;
Multiple submissions are allowed. For example, you submitted 3 screenshots with 3 different Brawl results. In this case, your best result will be eligible;
The contest starts now and concludes on September 9th at 7 pm CEDT.


Let's see who's the least puny of you, humans! Good luck!

